{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15213460","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15213460","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1521346001:0":{"text":"Fight for her...","source_cn":"努力争取……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C72C9BD62FDC3AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1521346002:0":{"text":"Y-you're right... I can't let her down.","source_cn":"我、我明白了……我不能辜负芙的心意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAA0E557F1763D2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521346003:0":{"text":"But I'm not ready to face her yet. If she saw me now, she'd only worry more.","source_cn":"但我现在还不能见她。要是她看见我受了伤，一定会担心得不得了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6300F994139BCE67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521346004:0":{"text":"I'll write her a letter... and tell her how I feel. Can I ask you to <style=\"highlight\">deliver it to her</style>?","source_cn":"我会写一封信……表明自己的心意。请你们替我<style...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E94C1991BCFA2C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1521346004":{"text":"I'll write her a letter... and tell her how I feel. Can I ask you to <style=\"highlight\">deliver it to her</style>?","source_cn":"我会写一封信……表明自己的心意。请你们替我<style=highlight>转交给芙</style>吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E94C1991BCFA2C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521346005:0":{"text":"Thank you...","source_cn":"谢谢……<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB13B2CC3C388635","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521346006:1":{"text":"As soon as I'm well enough, I'll go to her myself.","source_cn":"等过几天，我的伤好一点，就会去见她。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35EF19CF353435A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521346007:0":{"text":"Marco pulls himself together, carefully writes the letter, and places it in your hands.","source_cn":"马尔科振作起来，认真地写好了信，交到你手里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B8B55FCAEC32529","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521346008:0":{"text":"Go on. Take his letter and bring it to Fufu in Wrathwood Grove. She needs to hear what's in his heart.","source_cn":"现在，就把这封代表着心意的信带回树怒山谷，交给芙吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90E25F3CC55FF7B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"Of course.","source_cn":"没问题<ke